Go Roger Main,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: We Go Narrator,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:00:09.79,0:00:13.01,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Two years have passed since the war betweenDialogue: 50,0:00:13.01,0:00:18.55,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters, the Seven Warlords, and the Whitebeard Pirates.Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.14,0:00:25.71,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,On the deserted island northwest of the Isle of Women, Luscaina.Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.50,0:00:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm coming!Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.96,0:00:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. It's been two years already.Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.60,0:01:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch it. She's my friend.Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.48,0:01:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the ship is ready to set sail whenever you are!Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.84,0:01:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks!Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.42,0:01:44.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.70,0:01:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the boss of the island now.Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.88,0:01:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thing is, we became friends, so eating them went out the window.Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They do look tasty though.Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.57,0:02:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All your favorite foods are on the ship.Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.09,0:02:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I'd be a good wife since I'm thoughtful like that.Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.13,0:02:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting married, but thank you for the food!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.01,0:02:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help loving that harsh side of you!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh left six months ago.Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.10,0:02:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be waiting to meet you on Sabaody.Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.10,0:02:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was done teaching me the basics in the first year and a half.Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.90,0:02:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time I say goodbye to you guys and the island.Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.62,0:02:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright...Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.27,0:04:44.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you know that Navy Headquarters moved?Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.43,0:04:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? It was?Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.84,0:04:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they switched places with the G-1 branch,Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.07,0:04:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sandwiching the Red Line on either side.Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how determined Sengoku's successor is.Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.78,0:05:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, he set up their headquarters in the sea with the Four Emperors.Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.19,0:05:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But thanks to the switch, headquarters has less sway here,Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.09,0:05:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so there are more lawless areas on the island.Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.96,0:05:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm, no wonder it seems rougher here than two years ago.Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.33,0:05:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see this?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.14,0:05:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was shocked, too.Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.04,0:05:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the Straw Hats have resurfaced!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.44,0:05:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For real. They've been quiet for two years, so we thought they were dead.Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.08,0:05:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're even recruiting!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.18,0:05:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.16,0:05:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.18,0:05:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates who survived the first half of the Grand Line keep showing up.Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.79,0:05:45.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's enlisting them to expand his crew before running wild in the New World!Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.80,0:05:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds exciting! Maybe I should join too!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.23,0:05:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.73,0:05:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are people with bounties over 100 million on the island now.Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.24,0:05:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They definitely ain't taking you!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't say that!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.36,0:06:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you do anything about it?Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.82,0:06:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tickets are sold out! What else would you expect?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.16,0:06:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're talking about the superstar Soul King Brook's world tour!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.45,0:06:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island is the tour's final stop!Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.13,0:06:24.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The place is already packed!Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Manager!Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.73,0:06:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll put on a great show today!Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.67,0:06:38.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, that'd be nice!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.40,0:06:42.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your TD is doing very well and has sold over a million copies!Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.62,0:06:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You certainly are the king of soul music!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.26,0:06:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to the crowd!Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.12,0:06:58.00,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul King! Soul King! Soul King! Soul King!Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Manager,Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.63,0:06:58.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before the concert,Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.70,0:07:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have something important to say.Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.52,0:07:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby!Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.75,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are...Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.05,0:07:18.42,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.39,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.39,0:07:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.53,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.53,0:07:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.92,0:07:23.53,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.53,0:07:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.89,0:07:24.43,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.43,0:07:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone! Bone! Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.83,0:07:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone! Bone! Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.31,0:07:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone! Bone! Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.71,0:07:40.01,Rock Concert Secondary,,0,0,0,,♪ Bone to be wild! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.98,0:07:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it... How selfish can he be?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.16,0:07:45.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me a transponder snail!Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.65,0:07:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you get away with this, Brook!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.55,0:07:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make today the greatest anniversary!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.62,0:08:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Women! Real ones!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.56,0:08:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's no doubt!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.76,0:08:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are actual ladies in front of me!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.06,0:08:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, on this island, are the real ladiesDialogue: 50,0:08:24.04,0:08:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been dreaming of, night after night.Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.43,0:08:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Viva Sabaody!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.09,0:08:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need a lady!Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.40,0:08:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kyun!Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll leave you here.Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.81,0:08:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want to part, but I'm sure we'll meet again!Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.32,0:08:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never want to see you again! Thank you for the ride! Say "hi" to Ivan! Bye!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.41,0:08:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man, Sanji,Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.88,0:08:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has just come back from hell!Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.03,0:08:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what they say?Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.34,0:08:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boys can't help being mean to girls they like.Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.71,0:08:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's true. It happened to me.Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.29,0:09:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't ever forget him!Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.66,0:09:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Nami-swan, Robin-chwan!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.20,0:09:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did I hear wrong?Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.61,0:09:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A 55-million-belly bounty?Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.38,0:09:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Check the poster again!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.67,0:09:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,It says, "No bounties under 70 million."Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.34,0:09:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,We ain't dealing with no captains worth less than that.Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.09,0:09:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you guys even get here in one piece?Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.54,0:09:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost, scum.Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.13,0:09:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you know I'm the son of Dragon the Revolutionary?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,We don't need no dead weight!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,We're an exclusive pirate crew!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,We're in another league.Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.75,0:09:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Don't think just anyone can join us.Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.93,0:09:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost.Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.19,0:10:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is merciless.Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well yeah, he's already achieved so much.Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.29,0:10:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky, how many people we got so far?Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A hundred or so.Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.37,0:10:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three whole pirate groups have joined up.Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.20,0:10:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ten of them have bounties.Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.60,0:10:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good. And two of those are high-profile rookies.Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.65,0:10:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wet-Haired Caribou and Blood Spatter Coribou.Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both are known for killing marines.Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.18,0:10:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These brothers are captains with bounties of 210 million and 190 million.Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get some use out of 'em!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.64,0:10:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get more followers! Old man, we need another round!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.77,0:10:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? And you, woman, you've been there for quite a while.Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.93,0:11:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop drinking all alone and come join us!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's a beauty.Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.72,0:11:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not on your life. I'm waiting for a guy.Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She turned him down.Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.39,0:11:18.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, you better say yes!Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.56,0:11:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember?Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.40,0:11:25.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the crazy pirate who burst into the Summit War two years ago!Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.54,0:11:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've heard of him, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Waiting for a guy?Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.07,0:11:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta be some wimp who'd wail and beg for mercy after hearing Captain Luffy's name!Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.45,0:11:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get over here already!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.25,0:11:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll only say it once!Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.62,0:11:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You and I are not a good match, so I'm not drinking with you.Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.26,0:11:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.13,0:11:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Straw Hat... who?Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.42,0:11:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you say "who"?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.24,0:12:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you'd better apologize! You're in danger!Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.45,0:12:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.05,0:12:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of nerve!Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.69,0:12:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it.Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.70,0:12:31.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! You're a funny girl.Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'll make it easier for you.Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.10,0:12:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna drink with Captain Luffy?Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.91,0:12:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or are you gonna die?Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For your information, I have a bounty too.Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.51,0:12:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Cat Burglar Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.58,0:12:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Green Star:Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.32,0:12:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devil!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell is this?Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me, Captain!Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.07,0:13:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you dumbass!Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.31,0:13:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that plant?Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.18,0:13:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, young lady, do you wanna drink with me?Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, long time no see!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.76,0:13:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! You've gotten so strong!Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.19,0:13:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've blossomed a bunch yourself!Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.66,0:13:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! She was waiting for that young punk?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.17,0:13:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you do that?Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.10,0:13:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did! That's my new weapon: pop green!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.94,0:13:47.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like I've been gazing at the sea, doing nothing for two years.Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.61,0:13:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but...Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I no longer belong to the weak trio with you and Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.35,0:13:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I became a warrior who isn't fazed by anything!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.19,0:14:01.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, dude! Did you do this to us?Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.06,0:14:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Sogeking?! Why?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, forget about them!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.06,0:14:07.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere else.Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.56,0:14:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, I need a favor.Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.27,0:14:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh, Luffy?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.37,0:14:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, ma'am, you haven't paid yet!Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep the change!Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shit! They made us look bad!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.58,0:14:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.81,0:14:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.22,0:14:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What are these black bubbles?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.49,0:14:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell? A cloud?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.14,0:14:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What happened?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.34,0:14:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I got my hands on some new technology...Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.81,0:14:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really? You were in the sky?Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.91,0:15:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find those two and kill them!Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.12,0:15:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a report! At the Sabaody Archipelago...Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? The Straw Hats?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.29,0:15:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Reports say that they're recruiting new crew members.Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.23,0:15:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Report this to headquarters.Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.23,0:15:50.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he's really alive, that's bad news.Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gather the troops on the double!Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.84,0:15:56.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And intensify the search on Sabaody Archipelago!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I lose them?Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.30,0:16:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook's concert?Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.93,0:16:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats' recruitment?Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.97,0:16:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is going on?Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.31,0:16:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Soul King"?Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.58,0:16:37.75,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Wh-What?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.75,0:16:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,That swordsmoron was the first one here?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.52,0:16:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our next voyage will be rough.Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.22,0:16:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky-chan came second, about 10 days ago, and immediately went to see the ship.Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.93,0:16:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Sunny is safe, right?Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.93,0:16:57.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course. Not a scratch on her, and the coating's already done.Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.47,0:16:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good.Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.84,0:17:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did a good job.Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.37,0:17:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no regret for honorable wounds!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.21,0:17:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! A year to heal!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.01,0:17:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had such a strong sense of duty.Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Duval.Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.85,0:17:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, you think I'm handsome?Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.09,0:17:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I returned your favor, young master!Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.42,0:17:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether it was raining or windy,Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.16,0:17:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dangerous pirates were after your ship.Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.96,0:17:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I fought day after day with cuts and bruises!Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.93,0:17:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those were painful times!Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.57,0:17:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Duval!Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.40,0:17:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, how did you get hurt so badly?Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.64,0:17:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, fall for me... I mean, listen to me, young master.Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.37,0:17:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because the Navy finally...Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.01,0:17:42.45,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,And Nami-chan was the third...Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.45,0:17:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-swan!Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is she?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.85,0:17:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She went out shopping to kill time.Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.39,0:17:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about my story?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.35,0:17:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san's shopping! Nami-san's shopping!Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.02,0:17:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp-chan arrived fourth a few days ago and went to town.Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.96,0:18:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper-chan arrived fifth yesterday.Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.90,0:18:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook-chan came here today for a concert.Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A concert?Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.34,0:18:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then you came.Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.11,0:18:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So seven members including you have already arrived on the archipelago.Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen Nico Robin or Luffy yet.Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.68,0:18:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's extremely difficult just to get to this island.Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all are quite impressive.Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nice you'll be able to reunite.Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.36,0:18:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That aside, I can't believe you trained Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be incredibly strong now.Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in six months.Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm excited to see his progress.Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.50,0:18:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Progress...Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.34,0:18:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of "progress" Nami-san has made!Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.54,0:18:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.62,0:18:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! Sanji! Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.72,0:19:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We finally meet again, but you're acting weird!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.52,0:19:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sanji, you guys have grown so close over the past two years.Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.33,0:19:08.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why aren't you talking to me?Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.17,0:19:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's still following us.Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.23,0:19:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're being shy, you bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.04,0:19:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That tanuki knows a bit too much about us Straw Hats.Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.44,0:19:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about that too...Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.35,0:19:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could it be? Look at this.Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.75,0:19:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's...!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.79,0:19:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real Cotton Candy Lover Chopper, a 50-belly bounty!Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.42,0:19:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's their pet!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.49,0:19:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys changed a little. But I don't mind.Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.56,0:19:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must've dumped it on the island before they died, and now it's a stray.Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.03,0:19:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's following us because it thinks its masters are back.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.34,0:19:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's ditch that fox and take this one instead.Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.11,0:19:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the pet is identical to the poster, we'd look more authentic.Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.88,0:19:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna keep it? What does it eat?Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.91,0:19:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cotton candy!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.35,0:20:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have that.Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.49,0:20:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't need you anymore! Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.93,0:20:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come here, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.26,0:20:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a cucumber.Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scary! Robin, you're scary!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.80,0:20:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.04,0:20:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.31,0:20:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Hey, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are they?Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is really bad! Robin was abducted!Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.78,0:20:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're kidnappers!Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.95,0:20:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, shouldn't we report this to Captain Luffy?Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Have you guys seen Luffy already?Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.62,0:20:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right!Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.65,0:20:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must have new members by now too!Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'd better rescue Robin already, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.76,0:20:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lead the way!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.23,0:20:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Sabaody! We caught Nico Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.60,0:20:54.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With some fox creature that won't let go of her.Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.41,0:20:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I better hurry up. They might all be here by now.Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.11,0:21:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you alright?! Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.52,0:21:08.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's horrible!Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.85,0:21:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He shot her out of the blue!Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.69,0:21:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terrible!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.79,0:21:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me!Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.46,0:21:18.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did we do to you?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.56,0:21:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said, "sorry," didn't I?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.03,0:21:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mistook her for someone else!Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.00,0:21:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was looking for a couple that look just like you.Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.27,0:21:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A long-haired woman and a long-nosed man.Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.07,0:21:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mistook her and shot her on the spot?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.08,0:21:37.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My god! Straw Hat Luffy is horrible!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.35,0:21:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't tell me that you got a problem with me?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.52,0:21:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like you do.Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.73,0:21:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me! It's their fault!Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.53,0:21:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me! You alright?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.13,0:21:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find those two, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't just let them get away!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.57,0:22:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill them... to make an example!Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.59,0:22:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I run into you? Sorry!Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.97,0:22:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bye!Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.44,0:22:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.64,0:22:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he know who Straw Hat Luffy is?Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.11,0:22:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He's a dead man walking!Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.41,0:22:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.76,0:22:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.16,0:23:03.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Sabaody Archipelago in the distance.Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.77,0:23:07.64,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we have to say goodbye here.Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.64,0:23:10.64,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let them find out about our relationship.Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.31,0:23:12.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.41,0:23:13.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Put this on...Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.98,0:23:16.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,like this!Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.25,0:23:19.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't need that! It's too much!Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.15,0:23:20.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But in case something happens...Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.95,0:23:23.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.72,0:23:26.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to be careful.Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.89,0:23:29.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure you hide your face.Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.13,0:23:33.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The world thinks you're dead, but...Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.33,0:23:37.87,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,people still know what you look like from two years ago.Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.87,0:23:41.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If you cause trouble, you won't be able to set sail.Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.34,0:23:43.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it.Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.01,0:23:47.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And in the backpack, I put 500 changes of clothes, 1,000 lunches,Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.91,0:23:50.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,handkerchiefs and tissues, five years' worth of towels,Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.91,0:23:56.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,three years' worth of water and snacks, silverware, toothbrushes, soap,Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.19,0:23:59.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,hand creams, three years' worth of bug bite ointment, and...Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's way too much!Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.19,0:24:01.89,FlashbackSecondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.33,0:24:06.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish you a safe reunion with your crew.Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.50,0:24:09.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thank you for everything!Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.67,0:24:12.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck!Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.27,0:24:16.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard Sabaody has become perilous these days.Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.11,0:24:22.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's why the Nyavy is paying a lot of attention to what goes on there.Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.44,0:24:24.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Take extra care!Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.61,0:24:25.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Will do.Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.95,0:24:31.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If you need us, we Kuja Pirates will always come to help you!Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.89,0:24:34.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Please keep that in mind.Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.03,0:24:38.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And could you do me a favor?Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.69,0:24:41.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What? I'm not gonna marry you.Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.13,0:24:47.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I just want you to leave without saying goodbye.Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.80,0:24:51.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've never said that to anyone, anyway.Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.77,0:24:53.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see you again.Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.75,0:25:00.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm off!Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.02,0:25:00.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,See you!Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.98,0:25:02.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.32,0:25:04.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.59,0:25:07.49,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He said he wants to see me again!Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this what they call...Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.16,0:25:11.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,a proposal?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.89,0:25:14.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nyo, it's nyot!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.37,0:25:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hancock told me not to cause any trouble.Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.24,0:25:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you ran into me on purpose, didn't ya?Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.87,0:25:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-That guy is screwed!Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.98,0:26:08.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sunny !Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.82,0:26:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting for two years.Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.40,0:26:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're okay!Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.54,0:26:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got an absolute babe here!Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.94,0:26:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're our super archaeologist...Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.15,0:26:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, aren't you?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.74,0:27:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed at all, Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.94,0:27:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I've changed, silly!Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.21,0:27:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Witness the romantic masculinity jam-packed in my body!Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.35,0:27:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this fantastic, one-of-a-kind transformation!Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.62,0:27:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm beyond human understanding now!Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.39,0:27:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's probably hard to see you as a mere human now.Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.26,0:27:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, you sayin' I'm perverted?Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.00,0:27:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a great compliment!Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.45,0:27:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this the coating?Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.55,0:27:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like jelly.Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.52,0:27:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Rayleigh sure knows his stuff!Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.65,0:27:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now we can dive into the depths!Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.22,0:27:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What technology!Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.33,0:27:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just saw Rayleigh and the others.Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.86,0:28:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you went to the bar.Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.73,0:28:03.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What number were you?Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.40,0:28:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eighth.Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.33,0:28:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody's here except Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.44,0:28:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. We'll begin a new voyage soon.Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.27,0:28:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got the ship in tip-top condition.Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.65,0:28:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The new weapons are ready, too!Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.72,0:28:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.52,0:28:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, where are the others?Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.32,0:28:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp and Sanji were here earlier. Usopp left to buy fuel,Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.96,0:28:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and Sanji went shopping for food.Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.56,0:28:35.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Actually, on my way here...Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.40,0:28:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found this.Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.77,0:28:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you know about this? Who is Soul King?Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.51,0:28:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, about Brook.Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.31,0:28:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I knew about it. I've seen his TDs everywhere.Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.85,0:28:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's in the spotlight now.Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.55,0:28:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the dark, silent, foggy sea,Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.72,0:29:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,propelled into the bright lights of the stage, cheered on by legions of fans.Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.17,0:29:12.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He might not...Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.77,0:29:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,want to be a pirate again.Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.28,0:29:25.58,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Soul King is mysterious... ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.35,0:29:29.18,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,♪ He's nothing but bones! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.42,0:29:39.39,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Afro on the skull! Girls love the contrast! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.76,0:29:39.39,Rock Concert Secondary,,0,0,0,,♪ Girls love the contrast! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.39,0:29:43.80,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Wanna make her weak in the knees? ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.80,0:29:46.37,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Got milk! Got milk! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.37,0:29:54.34,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,♪ You need more calcium than protein! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.41,0:29:54.34,Rock Concert Secondary,,0,0,0,,♪ Ah-ahhh...! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.68,0:30:00.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say something?Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.75,0:30:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you run into me knowing who I was?Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.29,0:30:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see? You made me look like a chump.Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.12,0:30:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You humiliated me in public.Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.96,0:30:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're talking me here.Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.43,0:30:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm an elite pirate with a 400-million bounty!Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.17,0:30:21.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plant your knees on the grass, right now,Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.44,0:30:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and beg for your life!Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.78,0:30:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, fisherman, sell me some fish at your best price!Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.78,0:30:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is nobody here?Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.86,0:30:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you the owner?Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.99,0:30:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.06,0:30:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gone!Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.03,0:30:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The green-haired man!Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.47,0:30:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Green-haired? What happened?Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.30,0:30:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did something horrible! It happened just now...Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.61,0:31:00.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Old man, I wanna fish.Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.21,0:31:00.31,FlashbackSecondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.31,0:31:01.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.18,0:31:05.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Young man, you don't look like the fishing type.Dialogue: 50,0:31:06.38,0:31:09.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I promised to meet my friends on this island.Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.52,0:31:13.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But I got here first, and I haven't seen any of them yet.Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.36,0:31:17.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So I don't have anything to do.Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.06,0:31:19.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you take me out on your fishing boat?Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.09,0:31:23.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll take you out on that boat, so why don't you wait for me on board?Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.23,0:31:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I told him.Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.60,0:31:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Green hair, three swords, and a haramaki?Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.31,0:31:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he has a deep scar on his eye.Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.11,0:31:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know him?Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.08,0:31:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A scar on his eye?Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.41,0:31:39.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was it this guy?Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.65,0:31:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, this is the guy! Is he your friend?Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.62,0:31:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, let's say an acquaintance.Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.92,0:31:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told him to get on the fishing boat.Dialogue: 50,0:31:49.49,0:31:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.03,0:31:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But when I got back here...Dialogue: 50,0:31:55.56,0:31:57.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No, young man, that's not it!Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.37,0:31:59.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a pirate ship!Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.14,0:32:04.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys! We're setting sail for the New World that we've been dreaming of!Dialogue: 50,0:32:07.14,0:32:08.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wake up, young man!Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.71,0:32:11.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're on the wrong ship!Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.15,0:32:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I think he's heading for Fishman Island like that.Dialogue: 50,0:32:21.32,0:32:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:32:27.86,0:32:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought it was unlike him to show up first.Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.57,0:32:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd do something like this!Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.04,0:32:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was on a pirate ship! He might be dead by now!Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.84,0:32:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's okay. It's not your fault at all.Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.41,0:32:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He won't die. We're lucky we know where he's heading.Dialogue: 50,0:32:46.28,0:32:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That aside, can I have some fish?Dialogue: 50,0:32:47.88,0:32:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, but...Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.79,0:32:51.12,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:52.55,0:32:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at the water! Something is surfacing!Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.46,0:32:58.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.03,0:33:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge!Dialogue: 50,0:33:12.54,0:33:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a galleon!Dialogue: 50,0:33:14.41,0:33:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was it poorly coated and crushed by the water pressure?Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.65,0:33:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or attacked by sea kings?Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.31,0:33:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's been cut clean in half!Dialogue: 50,0:33:22.99,0:33:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be crazy!Dialogue: 50,0:33:24.35,0:33:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What could cut a ship this big?Dialogue: 50,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.29,0:33:32.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin our dream of going to the New World?!Dialogue: 50,0:33:33.90,0:33:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A twist of fate!Dialogue: 50,0:33:35.93,0:33:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should blame your own cursed fate thatDialogue: 50,0:33:38.13,0:33:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,brought a plague onto your ship.Dialogue: 50,0:33:41.07,0:33:43.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So self-righteous!Dialogue: 50,0:33:43.07,0:33:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.11,0:33:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody's on the ship!Dialogue: 50,0:33:45.31,0:33:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's back. Could've stayed gone for all I care.Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.42,0:33:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got on...Dialogue: 50,0:34:01.16,0:34:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the wrong ship.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:39.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Two Years LaterDialogue: 1,0:04:33.86,0:04:39.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Two Years LaterDialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:33.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ten-Odd Days Later at a BarDialogue: 1,0:04:30.05,0:04:33.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ten-Odd Days Later at a BarDialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:30.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,m 473.4 576.6 b 467 575 464.2 573.1 454.8 563.1 443.8 551.7 442.9 548.2 445.6 527.3 446.1 523.5 445.5 518 443.2 506.3 441.6 497.6 439.6 486.7 439 482 438.3 477.3 436.7 467 435.4 459 434.1 451 433 443.3 433 441.7 433 440.2 432.7 439 432.3 439 432 439 429.4 440.5 426.6 442.4 408.3 454.4 403 457.1 392.4 459.6 372.8 464.2 359.7 457.5 358.3 442.2 357.4 431.9 358.5 429.8 374.7 412.3 382.7 403.6 390.4 394.9 391.8 393 393.3 391.1 396.2 387.4 398.5 384.9 414 367.4 434.1 338.4 443.2 320.5 452 303.2 454.4 300.2 462.1 296 468.2 292.7 469.1 292.5 480 292.2 492.5 291.8 499.4 293.3 507 298.3 l 510.5 300.7 512.3 298.4 b 517.5 291.5 530.6 286 541.8 286 551.5 286 555.6 287.5 561 292.9 564.8 296.7 566.1 299.1 568.3 305.9 570.7 313.1 571.8 318 574.7 334.5 l 575.2 337.5 588.4 337.5 601.7 337.5 600.4 333.5 b 599.7 331.3 598.4 327.4 597.6 324.7 596.7 322.1 594.9 318.3 593.6 316.2 587.2 306.4 586.4 294.2 591.7 286.6 593.8 283.6 597 281.3 603.8 277.7 615.4 271.6 621.4 270.7 630.8 273.9 638.3 276.5 639.7 276.2 658.5 267.9 670.4 262.7 670.6 262.6 682.3 262.2 691.2 261.9 695.2 262.2 698.9 263.4 l 703.8 265 707.4 261.5 b 712.6 256.6 717.2 255.7 732.4 256.3 l 745.4 256.8 760.4 252.4 b 778.2 247.2 789.1 246.5 800 250 807.7 252.5 818.2 259.8 821.8 265.3 824.3 269 824.5 270.3 824.7 280.2 824.9 291.5 828.1 310.4 838.2 362 841.2 377.4 842.7 385.4 844.5 395.5 847.8 414.3 849.6 421.5 859.7 456.4 860 457.6 861.3 454.8 863.5 448.4 868.5 433 870.3 423.6 869.6 416.6